  << /ActualText (Developed an end\055to\055end manga translation mobile application using Flutter\054 integrating Faster R\055CNN for element detection\054 MangaOCR for Japanese character recognition\054 and GPT\0554\0561 for context\055aware translation\056 Built the complete ML pipeline from scratch\054 including dataset collection\054 manual image labeling\054 and model training\054 before integrating into mobile\056 The complete pipeline processes a full manga page in 5\05510 seconds\054 covering detection\054 OCR\054 translation\054 and mobile rendering\056)
